usage: audit_checkpoint.py [-h] --config CONFIG --out OUT
                           [--device {cpu,cuda}]

Read-only evidence audit of a pinned TRAIN/validation checkpoint. Never
trains. Only aggregate results are exported. The shared threshold is taken
unchanged from the checkpoint. Gain perturbations are diagnostics, not image
corruptions.

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --out OUT
  --device {cpu,cuda}
